UniversalRewardsDistributor::rescueRewardTokens
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when contract is not paused
│   └── it should revert with RewardsDistributorNotPaused
└── when caller is owner and contract is paused
    ├── when contract has no balance
    │   ├── it should not emit any events
    │   └── it should transfer nothing to owner
    ├── when contract has balance
    │   ├── it should transfer the specified amount to owner
    │   └── it should emit RescueRewardTokens event with correct parameters
    └── when rescuing with different token
        ├── it should transfer the specified amount to owner
        └── it should emit RescueRewardTokens event with correct parameters
